{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "header",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# 📚 Peta Sistematika Bab: Buku Tafsir Bakat 40 (TB-40)\n**Rujukan Otoritatif Manhaj PKN • Ustadz Abdul Kholiq**\n*Pengembangan oleh Harridi Ilman Tovid - Yayasan Bina Insan Taqwa - Yayasan Bina Insan Mustaqbal*",
      "x": 0,
      "y": -160,
      "width": 680,
      "height": 110,
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "bab1",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "### 📌 Bab 1: Teologi Bakat Fitrah\nSetiap insan dimudahkan untuk takdir penciptaannya (kullun muyassarun lima khuliqa lah). Tolak fabrikasi keseragaman.",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 680,
      "height": 100,
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "bab2",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "### 📌 Bab 2: Taksonomi 40 Pilar Bakat (TB-40)\nPeta komprehensif 40 sifat produktif nabawiyah yang digali dari Al-Quran dan hadits shahih.",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 140,
      "width": 680,
      "height": 100,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "bab3",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "### 📌 Bab 3: Rumpun Berpikir (Fikr)\n5 pilar: Fathonah, Hikmah, Tadabbur, Shamt, dan Nazhar. Nalar jernih pemandu syariat.",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 280,
      "width": 680,
      "height": 100,
      "color": "2"
    },
    {
      "id": "bab4",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "### 📌 Bab 4: Rumpun Berperasaan (Qalb)\n6 pilar: Haya, Wara, Raja, Khauf, Sabr, dan Syukr. Radar nurani dan integritas batin.",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 420,
      "width": 680,
      "height": 100,
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "bab5",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "### 📌 Bab 5: Rumpun Bekerja Keras (Amal)\n6 pilar: Itqan, Himmah, Syajaaah, Mujahadah, Jiddiyah, dan Sabat. Stamina amal dan jihad.",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 560,
      "width": 680,
      "height": 100,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "bab6",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "### 📌 Bab 6: Rumpun Bekerja Sama (Ukhuwah)\n8 pilar: Taawun, Ulfah, Nashihah, Hilm, Rahmah, Samahah, Afw, dan Tawadhu.",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 700,
      "width": 680,
      "height": 100,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "bab7",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "### 📌 Bab 7: Rumpun Memerintah (Qiyadah)\n7 pilar: Adl, Amanah, Hazm, Syura, Qudwah, Tabligh, dan Firatsah. Kepemimpinan adil.",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 840,
      "width": 680,
      "height": 100,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "bab8",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "### 📌 Bab 8: Rumpun Melayani (Khidmah)\n8 pilar: Itsar, Karam, Diyafah, Rifq, Taawun, Infaq, Islah, dan Syafaah. Kerendahan hati berkhidmat.",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 980,
      "width": 680,
      "height": 100,
      "color": "1"
    }
  ],
